Sugarchain platform integration
==============================

Apple Silicon uses Advanced SIMD (NEON) for the existing Salsa and PWX
operations in yespower-opt.c. The implementation is selected only when both
__APPLE__ and __aarch64__ are defined. Other targets retain their existing
SSE2 or generic implementation.

The unsigned arithmetic, lane layout, scratch-memory lookup offsets, algorithm
parameters and output bytes are unchanged. The implementation does not cache
or skip proof computations. crypto_tests/yespower_golden_vectors covers both
Yespower versions, the official Sugar parameters, scratch-memory reuse and
unaligned input against outputs verified with the original scalar and SSE2
implementations. Header, target and chain validation remain unchanged.
